Good Morning Ron,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Hopefully the school and the student body fared well in this most recent New England surprise.&nbsp; With hopefully Spring around the corner here at the Red Cross we are planning for the 18-19 school year and looking to partner with new school sponsors for our programs.&nbsp; I would like to set up a meeting with either you, the school nurse or a designate to discuss these programs and to see if they are a fit for the upcoming school year.&nbsp; I look forward to your thoughts.<br />
